  "summary": "Malicious code in slotozen (npm)",
  "details": "Slotozen@1.0.0 is an inert SEO-spam package: its only code is an empty module export, with no install scripts, no binaries, and no dependencies. The package ships a README that promotes the online casino sites slotozencasino[.]net and slotozen8[.]com. It contains no executable payload; the finding is based on the package's association with a publisher known for publishing malicious packages.",
